---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Work" description="Matthew Rossi's work history — senior software engineer at Heroku, Capital One, and Braintree.">

  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Work</h1>
    <p>Thirteen years across cloud infrastructure, financial services, and fintech.</p>
  </div>

  <section aria-label="Work history">

    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-header">
        <div class="entry-meta">
          <span class="company">Heroku (Salesforce)</span>
          <span class="role">Senior Software Engineer</span>
        </div>
        <span class="date">Jun 2021–present</span>
      </div>
      <p>Designed and built Heroku's secure credential and authorization management system across multiple internal platforms. Architected the microservice layer for a next-generation data synchronization platform, with a focus on maintainability, scalability, and traceable ownership. Led efforts to improve on-call health and long-term operational sustainability in a high-availability environment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-header">
        <div class="entry-meta">
          <span class="company">Capital One</span>
          <span class="role">Senior Software Engineer</span>
        </div>
        <span class="date">Apr 2019–Jun 2021</span>
      </div>
      <p>Built an internal underwriting and portfolio-management system for the Commercial Banking division under strict regulatory and financial constraints. Worked across product, business, and technical teams to gather requirements, evaluate trade-offs, and ensure software reliability for commercial risk analysis and compliance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-header">
        <div class="entry-meta">
          <span class="company">Braintree</span>
          <span class="role">Software Engineer</span>
        </div>
        <span class="date">Apr 2016–Mar 2019</span>
      </div>
      <p>Developed payment processing features in a test-driven environment. Led a cross-functional team of ~20 to design and deliver an internal engineering conference for ~200 attendees. Mentored a cohort of software development apprentices on object-oriented programming and software design fundamentals.</p>
    </div>

  </section>

</Base>
